  "description": "The RAMONES 24 benefits from the same design quality as our adult bikes. Nothing is left to chance: internal brake routing, thru-axles, UDH derailleur hanger. This is a real mountain bike built for demanding young riders.\n• The in-house designed RIDE ALPHA cockpit features a short stem and wide handlebar, perfectly adapted to junior sizes for optimal control.\n• The TEKTRO Aries disc brakes come with levers specifically designed for small hands, ensuring precise speed control and safe braking in all conditions.\n• VEE TIRE CrownGem tyres provide excellent grip and high air volume for safe and comfortable riding on all terrain types.\n• The 7-speed SHIMANO Tourney drivetrain, combined with the Revoshift twist shifter, offers simple and intuitive control perfect for teaching kids how to manage their effort like the pros.",
